  "idea": "How to turn paper documents into search-ready PDFs using your phone",
  "text": "Your smartphone has a built-in document scanner that automatically turns physical paper into searchable text. Most professionals waste hours manually retyping printed invoices and signed agreements into desktop documents. Normal camera photos leave dark shadows, skewing proportions and making small print impossible to index. Open Adobe Scan or Apple Notes, point your camera, and let auto-cropping export a crisp PDF. You extract readable text and find invoices instantly.",
